<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;color:<%= t['ink-950'] %>;">Claude tracking stops on <%= endDate %></h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">The plan for <strong><%= orgName %></strong> was changed to one that does not include Claude. We keep checking Claude until <strong><%= endDate %></strong>, the end of the period you have already paid for, and then we stop.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">It is on for: <%= projectNames %>.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Nothing is deleted. Claude&rsquo;s earlier answers stay in your history, and after <%= endDate %> Claude shows as &ldquo;Not tracked&rdquo;, never as a drop to zero. Your other engines carry on as before.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">To keep Claude, switch back to a plan that includes it before <%= endDate %>. Tracking then carries on without a break.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;"><a href="<%= billingUrl %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background-color:<%= t['brand-600'] %>;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;border-radius:8px;">See your plan</a></p>
